emer2560.png", "id": "550695450706239", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569458_550695454039572_621185582599839680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TGZJOO-mWnEQ7kNvwHvvS6G&_nc_oc=AdpMhLVQAf_skwQLjDYCXVIlJ_Fgr6icbzuA2hqekFpVuv3OaQnCDqBN_RqG1TIjbGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqpZM6ZV9OxrkQ651hbzGro2qHFQABIwJEWnzfdRwzVA&oe=6ADDF40B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GoogleHero2560x1440.png", "id": "1163150092629669", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619832_1163150095963002_2471619083655307891_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_66hF1-8JQQ7kNvwGmrLmF&_nc_oc=AdpQe5DIJZhdwo4-qe_AHH_qAv8miYT_PCRxrSKgBOoqGtWUzA4Kz0WUbBAZMs3DeBw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOf4GVE5h3QswtKWvYIJnbSYt48q9o4oyDdzB3p97JrAA&oe=6ADDF358"}, "display_name": "FLY - A Google Earth Flight Sim", "keywords": ["Earth", "Flight", "Explore", "World", "Travel"], "long_description": "# New!\n\ud83d\udece\ufe0f AI Concierge (Premium Add-On)\n\n- Listen and reply in ANY language\n\n- Act as a tour guide\n\n- Search and take you anywhere\n\n- So much more\n\n# Features\n\n\n\ud83d\udc65 Multiplayer with up to 8 People\n\n\n\ud83d\udd0d Improved Search  \n\n\ud83c\udf0f Travel Through Google Street View\n\n\ud83d\udd16 Bookmarks  \n\n\ud83c\udf07 Dynamic and Adjustable Time of Day  \n\n\ud83d\udc09New Dragon Avatars (Premium Add-On)\n\n\ud83c\udf0c Unlockable Sky Boxes  \n\n\ud83d\ude81 Mode 2 Drone Controls \n\n\ud83d\udcfb Expanded Radio Stations  \n\nEmbark on an extraordinary journey with FLY, and redefine the way you explore our planet. Powered by Google's cutting-edge 3D Maps Tiles, FLY lets you soar through the skies and witness the world's wonders like never before. From the ground all the way to the edge of space, you can truly Fly for the first time alone or with friends.\n\n{976640067815582}\n\n**Global Exploration:** Fly taps into Google's vast repository of 3D tiles, offering a true-to-life representation of Earth. Traverse majestic landscapes, iconic landmarks, and hidden gems from the comfort of your home. Whether it's the towering peaks of the Himalayas, the bustling streets of Tokyo, or triumphs of human engineering like the Eiffel Tower in Paris, the world is yours to discover.\n{1173106120490071}\n**Unique Motion in Flight:**  Enjoy a seamless and intuitive flying experience designed for comfort first. Soar over mountains, glide through valleys, and experience the thrill of flight.\n\n{982449550039825}\nUnleash your inner adventurer with Fly \u2013 and experience the joys of Google Earth with just the power of your Quest headset.", "short_description": "Embark on an extraordinary journey with Fly, powered by Google's 3D Maps Tiles. Soar through the skies, from the Alps to Tokyo, and explore Earth's wonders. Fly offers a true-to-life representation of the world, allowing you to traverse landscapes and iconic landmarks. With unique motion controls, experience the rush of wind as you navigate mountains and valleys. Enjoy a curated soundtrack with built-in Feed.fm. Elevate your senses, broaden your horizons, unleash your inner adventurer with Fly."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virzoom.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056428751", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://virzoom.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056435331", "publisher_name": "VirZOOM", "support_website_url": "https://virzoom.com/help", "website_url": "https://virzoom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_gra